{
  "_what": "The skill bundle rule, as cases. Each case is a bundle and the problem skillBundleProblem must report for it: null when the bundle may travel, otherwise a pattern the problem must match. This file lives in two repositories and must be the same in both: orion-self-install tests/skill-bundle-cases.json (run against status/shapes.mjs) and dailypractice-mono apps/enablement/tests/unit/skill-bundle-cases.json (run against apps/enablement/lib/library/bundle.ts). Each suite pins this file's fingerprint, so a change here fails until it is made in both places. Accents are written as escapes on purpose, so no editor can quietly change how they are typed.",
